Checked factors from cos(phi)-1, the rank-one determinant expansion, zero couplings and forcing independent of alpha\_1; did not identify the Melnikov approximation with an exact splitting. This was an LLM adversarial audit, not independent human verification; no theorem prover was used. Prompts A then B applied to this ID: Checked factors from cos(phi)-1, the rank-one determinant expansion, zero couplings and forcing independent of alpha\_1; did not identify the Melnikov approximation with an exact splitting. Scope remains limited: Control the nonlinear invariant-manifold remainder relative to the exponentially small leading determinant uniformly for bounded fast forcing.

